      "text/markdown": [
       "\n",
       "# Report: example1\n",
       "         \n",
       "\n",
       "- *filename*:  example1.dyno\n",
       "- *name*:  example1\n",
       "- *variables* (9):      `r`, `n`, `k`, `y`, `i`, `c`, `w`, `a`, `epsilon`\n",
       "    - *exogenous* (1):  `epsilon`\n",
       "    -  *endogenous* (**8**):  `r`, `n`, `k`, `y`, `i`, `c`, `w`, `a`\n",
       "- *equations*(8)\n",
       "- *7 parameters*:    `beta`, `delta`, `nss`, `eta`, `alpha`, `rho`, `chi`\n",
       "\n",
       ":::{dropdown} Calibration\n",
       "Parameter values\n",
       "```{code} python\n",
       "{'beta': 0.985, 'delta': 0.025, 'nss': 0.33, 'eta': 1.0, 'alpha': 0.32, 'rho': 0.9, 'chi': 1.7233112348878612}\n",
       "```\n",
       "Steady state values\n",
       "```{code} python\n",
       "{'r': 0.04022842639593902, 'n': 0.33, 'k': 6.965472900569777, 'y': 0.8756562934171224, 'i': 0.17413682251424445, 'c': 0.7015194709028779, 'w': 1.804382665223161, 'a': 1, 'epsilon': 0.0}\n",
       "```\n",
       ":::\n",
       "\n",
       ":::{dropdown} Equations                    \n",
       "$$\\displaystyle \\text{} \\quad \\frac{1}{c_{t}} = \\frac{\\beta \\cdot \\left(r_{t+1} + 1 - \\delta\\right)}{c_{t+1}} \\quad (1)$$\n",
       "\n",
       "$$\\displaystyle \\text{} \\quad w_{t} = \\frac{\\chi \\cdot c_{t}}{{\\left(1 - n_{t}\\right)}^{\\eta}} \\quad (2)$$\n",
       "\n",
       "$$\\displaystyle \\text{} \\quad k_{t} = \\left(1 - \\delta\\right) \\cdot k_{t-1} + i_{t} \\quad (3)$$\n",
       "\n",
       "$$\\displaystyle \\text{} \\quad y_{t} = a_{t} \\cdot {k_{t-1}}^{\\alpha} \\cdot {n_{t}}^{1 - \\alpha} \\quad (4)$$\n",
       "\n",
       "$$\\displaystyle \\text{} \\quad \\mathrm{log}\\left(a_{t}\\right) = \\rho \\cdot \\mathrm{log}\\left(a_{t-1}\\right) + \\epsilon_{t} \\quad (5)$$\n",
       "\n",
       "$$\\displaystyle \\text{} \\quad w_{t} = \\frac{\\left(1 - \\alpha\\right) \\cdot y_{t}}{n_{t}} \\quad (6)$$\n",
       "\n",
       "$$\\displaystyle \\text{} \\quad r_{t} = \\frac{\\alpha \\cdot y_{t}}{k_{t-1}} \\quad (7)$$\n",
       "\n",
       "$$\\displaystyle \\text{} \\quad y_{t} = c_{t} + i_{t} \\quad (8)$$\n",
       ":::     \n",
       "\n",
       "---\n",
       "\n",
       "## Check\n",
       ":::{tip} Blanchard-Kahn conditions are met\n",
       ":class: dropdown\n",
       "Sorted by modulus:\n",
       "```{code} python\n",
       "[0.         0.         0.         0.         0.         0.\n",
       " 0.9        0.93984577 1.08020747        inf        inf        inf\n",
       "        inf        inf        inf        inf]\n",
       "```\n",
       ":::\n",
       "\n",
       "---\n",
       "                    \n",
